      "content": "I'm a bit worried about that. If we \"reframe\" it, isn't there a risk the FDA will see right through it? The nausea data is a hard fact. If the campaign says \"superior comfort\" but the data shows more nausea than the generic, aren't we basically lying to the consumers? I don't want us to get hit with a warning letter right after launch.",
